   "text": "America’s \"let it rip\" approach to AI aligns with the technology's productivity potential and national security imperatives. \nHowever, it has fallen short not only on safety and diffusion, but also on bringing society along.\nThe resulting backlash evident in the midterms was",
   "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2118479462551392432"
